<title>USA: IPO FILING - Rankin Automotive Group Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Rankin Automotive Group Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Rankin Automotive Group Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			RAVE.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $10-$12/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    1.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 1.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  none</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    4.55 million</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Nichols, Safina, Lerner &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  225,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Alexandria, La.,-based company is a specialty retailer and supplier of automotive replacement parts, tools, supplies, equipment and accesories.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To repay debt and for the acquisition and opening of new stores and working capital.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s, for fiscal year ended February 25:</p>
<p>				  1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		$21,032	     $13,957</p>
<p>   - Net Income (loss)	310		  (140)</p>
